  "strings": {
    "%lld builds listed; updated with TestFlight releases.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld builds listed; updated with TestFlight releases."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收录 %lld 个 build；随 TestFlight 版本更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access to WeChat files was denied; this error alone does not identify the cause. Check each item:\n1. Administrator access: root-owned files or missing user write access require administrator authorization for this operation.\n2. File permissions and locks: check the reported file and its directory for ownership, access permissions, ACLs and immutable flags (uchg/schg). Administrator authorization may not remove a lock.\n3. App Management: if file permissions are correct, allow the current WeChatUnrevoke in System Settings → Privacy & Security → App Management, then quit and reopen it. This system permission is separate from administrator authorization.\nEntitlements are shown in Details and are separate from file write permissions. Keep the original engine log when copying diagnostics.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Access to WeChat files was denied; this error alone does not identify the cause. Check each item:\n1. Administrator access: root-owned files or missing user write access require administrator authorization for this operation.\n2. File permissions and locks: check the reported file and its directory for ownership, access permissions, ACLs and immutable flags (uchg/schg). Administrator authorization may not remove a lock.\n3. App Management: if file permissions are correct, allow the current WeChatUnrevoke in System Settings → Privacy & Security → App Management, then quit and reopen it. This system permission is separate from administrator authorization.\nEntitlements are shown in Details and are separate from file write permissions. Keep the original engine log when copying diagnostics."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信文件的读写被拒绝；仅凭这条错误不能确定原因。请逐项检查：\n1. 管理员权限：文件属于 root 或当前用户无写权限时，需要在本次操作中完成管理员授权。\n2. 文件权限与锁定：检查报错文件及其目录的所有者、访问权限、ACL 和不可变标记（uchg/schg）；管理员授权不一定能解除锁定。\n3. App 管理：若上述权限正常，到「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → App 管理」允许当前 WeChatUnrevoke 修改其他 App，然后完全退出并重开。本项系统授权与管理员授权是两回事。\n签名权限是否完好见详情，与文件写权限分开判断。复制诊断报告时请保留原始引擎日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An ACL denies writing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An ACL denies writing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访问控制规则拒绝写入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An access-control entry (ACL) denies writing to WeChat's files. Inspect it with ls -le in Terminal and remove the deny entry, then retry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An access-control entry (ACL) denies writing to WeChat's files. Inspect it with ls -le in Terminal and remove the deny entry, then retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信文件上有一条拒绝写入的访问控制规则（ACL）。在终端用 ls -le 查看，去掉那条 deny 规则后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
