            "value": "Every patch point is written back to its original bytes and the bundle is re-signed. Anti-recall stops working and WeChat's auto-updater comes back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会把所有补丁点写回原始字节并重新签名。防撤回随之失效，微信的自动更新也会恢复。"
          }
