            "value": "补丁库缺失，请重新安装此测试包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bytes at a patch point are neither pristine nor mine — most likely another tool touched them. Reinstall WeChat, then come back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bytes at a patch point are neither pristine nor mine — most likely another tool touched them. Reinstall WeChat, then come back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "补丁点上的字节既不是原始的、也不是我写的 —— 多半是另一个工具动过。重装微信后再来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
