    "The engine did not finish within %llds and was terminated. Re-signing a large WeChat bundle is slow — try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The engine did not finish within %llds and was terminated. Re-signing a large WeChat bundle is slow — try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎 %lld 秒没跑完，已经掐掉了。微信包很大时重签名会慢，可以再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message stays and no recall tip is shown at all.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The message stays and no recall tip is shown at all."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消息留着，完全不显示撤回提示，对方那边也看不出你装了什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message stays and one-to-one chats still show \"X recalled a message\" — you see both what was recalled and that it was. Group chats keep the message but show no tip.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The message stays and one-to-one chats still show \"X recalled a message\" — you see both what was recalled and that it was. Group chats keep the message but show no tip."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消息留着，私聊里仍然显示「对方撤回了一条消息」——你知道对方撤了什么，也知道对方撤过。群聊目前只保留消息、不出提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The patch configuration does not yet support build %@. Configuration updates arrive online; new engine rules may require a WeChatUnrevoke update.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The patch configuration does not yet support build %@. Configuration updates arrive online; new engine rules may require a WeChatUnrevoke update."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "补丁库尚未支持 build %@。配置会联网更新；如果需要新的引擎规则，请安装新版 WeChatUnrevoke。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The patch configuration has build %@, but only for the other processor architecture. On this Mac WeChat runs %@ code, so applying those points would change nothing — the switch is not offered. Points for this architecture arrive with online configuration updates once they are covered.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The patch configuration has build %@, but only for the other processor architecture. On this Mac WeChat runs %@ code, so applying those points would change nothing — the switch is not offered. Points for this architecture arrive with online configuration updates once they are covered."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "补丁库有 build %@ 的补丁点，但只有另一种处理器架构的；这台 Mac 上微信运行的是 %@ 代码，照着打不会有任何效果，所以不提供开启。该架构的补丁点收录后会随配置联网更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wechattweak engine is missing from this app bundle — this build is incomplete, please download WeChatUnrevoke again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The wechattweak engine is missing from this app bundle — this build is incomplete, please download WeChatUnrevoke again."
