    "Update block": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update block"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新拦截"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates can remove patches. Reapply only after full protection previously succeeded, with WeChat closed and no password needed. Otherwise, only notify.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates can remove patches. Reapply only after full protection previously succeeded, with WeChat closed and no password needed. Otherwise, only notify."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信更新可能清除补丁。曾成功开启完整保护、无需密码且微信已退出时，自动重新应用；条件不满足时只发提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version lookup only; current protection has not been checked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version lookup only; current protection has not been checked."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里只核对版本；当前防撤回状态未检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat has not fully quit yet. Its helper processes linger a few seconds after the main one — wait a moment and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat has not fully quit yet. Its helper processes linger a few seconds after the main one — wait a moment and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信还没完全退出。它的辅助进程会比主进程多活几秒，等一下再点一次就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat is on a read-only location (opened straight from the disk image, or translocated). Drag WeChat into Applications and use that copy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat is on a read-only location (opened straight from the disk image, or translocated). Drag WeChat into Applications and use that copy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信在只读位置（直接从磁盘映像里打开，或被系统隔离转移）。把微信拖进「应用程序」文件夹，再对那一份操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat is running": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat is running"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信正在运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat lost its entitlements": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat lost its entitlements"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信的签名权限掉了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat updated to %@ and the patch is gone. Open WeChatUnrevoke and click once to put it back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat updated to %@ and the patch is gone. Open WeChatUnrevoke and click once to put it back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信更新到 %@，补丁被抹掉了。打开 WeChatUnrevoke 点一下就能装回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat updated to %@; the anti-recall patch has been re-applied automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat updated to %@; the anti-recall patch has been re-applied automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信更新到 %@，防撤回补丁已经自动打回去了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat version"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat versions & diagnostics · TestFlight": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat versions & diagnostics · TestFlight"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信版本与诊断 · TestFlight"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat's auto-updater is blocked too, so the next update can't silently wipe the patch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat's auto-updater is blocked too, so the next update can't silently wipe the patch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信的自动更新也拦住了，补丁不会被下一次更新悄悄抹掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat's binary can only be modified while it is fully quit — otherwise macOS kills it mid-write and leaves a half-signed bundle.\n\nQuit WeChat now? It will be reopened once the patch is done.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat's binary can only be modified while it is fully quit — otherwise macOS kills it mid-write and leaves a half-signed bundle.\n\nQuit WeChat now? It will be reopened once the patch is done."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改动微信的程序文件必须在它完全退出时进行，否则 macOS 会在中途把它杀掉，留下一个签名残破的微信。\n\n要现在退出微信吗？打完补丁我再帮你打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat's files are locked (immutable flag — \"Locked\" in Finder's Get Info). An administrator password does not bypass a lock. Untick Locked in Finder, or run chflags -R nouchg /Applications/WeChat.app in Terminal, then retry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat's files are locked (immutable flag — \"Locked\" in Finder's Get Info). An administrator password does not bypass a lock. Untick Locked in Finder, or run chflags -R nouchg /Applications/WeChat.app in Terminal, then retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信文件被锁定（不可变标记，访达「显示简介」里的「已锁定」）。管理员密码绕不过锁定。先在访达取消「已锁定」，或在终端执行 chflags -R nouchg /Applications/WeChat.app，然后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeChat's files belong to another user (usually root) and this user cannot write them. Try again and complete the administrator authorization in the system dialog.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat's files belong to another user (usually root) and this user cannot write them. Try again and complete the administrator authorization in the system dialog."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "微信文件属于其他用户（通常是 root），当前用户没有写权限。再点一次并在弹出的系统对话框里完成管理员授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
